", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974685_1840524873122821_3055739933188055904_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wh0QWt6mMGoQ7kNvwG2p1me&_nc_oc=AdodJsrB1UEjoe_JupjFYWRkwv3ebW3sjKQ5ivbvTxf8QR8-N06OJ8Syd0KB65o4u2s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6JbercPAcz2RAz3c3TDG-rrnoPmAcqewZ-JDl1FUiFWA&oe=6A1996F9"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "3474397939524850", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974494_3474397942858183_7325370313459975246_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=N9Y5pZikq-YQ7kNvwEdgT7L&_nc_oc=AdqPJYRR6z3pB349sdPSXSd1eABpTjzgVhxaPrq2OWFN4fvRJtsJTasPDQBWrCvZ6U0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5kCYFzUdZQ19qGdG1hhHAnrHmJS8e2t-Sfn9sB_aHfGw&oe=6A19ADCB"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Hard Drive Logo (6).png", "id": "1060475455596738", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984476_1060475458930071_8663595066419356644_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IBrOBAhqodkQ7kNvwESJjl-&_nc_oc=Adp1iDW9no_HPp349gSUOGdM13r09PY_ZJMQK7IVjks_VK5D_vUf3rMeFHCQ0Vx_nP4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6KTenZqAoSCC3kiF4kV3C-yifFoiwh_3RA7dhGkRdDmQ&oe=6A19AC4E"}, "display_name": "Hard Drive", "keywords": [], "long_description": "# *Hard Drive* \n\nHard Drive is a fast-paced, multiplayer, competitive electro combat driving game. Players control sleek, neon-lit motorcycle looking vehicles, known as bykes, which leave behind a temporary solid trail of light as they move. Players must outmaneuver their opponents by creating a trails of light that they cannot avoid crashing into, while avoiding the trails left by other players.\n\n# _Current Features_\n- Non PvP Driving Park\n- 6 Player Combat Arena\n- Season Pass with Progression Rewards\n- Cosmetic Shop \n\n## More Coming Soon. . .", "short_description": "Electro Combat Driving "}]}, "devel